OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy or
OL,6,Fpartly cloudy during this evening and
OL,7,Fovernight with occasional showers,
OL,8,Fthese mainly across the Northwest
OL,9,FHighlands. Some early clear spells
OL,10,Ffurther east. Touch of frost possible.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FMainly dry with bright spells
OL,13,Fand the odd shower. A few sunny or
OL,14,Fclear spells and winds remaining light.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FPlenty
OL,17,Fdry and settled weather under an area
OL,18,Fof high pressure. Variable cloud
OL,19,Famounts with some clear or sunny
OL,20,Fspells possible at times. Frost and
OL,21,Ffog if skies remain clear.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
